{
    "title": "Pok Pok | Montessori Preschool",
    "description": "Pok Pok is a Montessori-inspired playroom for kids aged 2-8. Our interactive learning games are open-ended with no levels, winning or losing. This makes for calming and non-addictive play so kids can stay regulated, which also means less tantrums! Offline play means no Wi-Fi needed.\r\n\r\nTry Pok Pok for free today!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc6 WINNER OF: \r\nAPPLE DESIGN AWARD \r\nACADEMICS\u2019 CHOICE AWARD\r\nAPP STORE AWARD\r\nBEST LEARNING APP KIDSCREEN AWARD\r\nGOOD HOUSEKEEPING AWARD\r\n\r\n*As seen in Forbes, TechCrunch, Business Insider, CNET, etc!*\r\n\r\nWhether you have a baby, toddler, preschool kid, first-grader or beyond, our educational games are inspired by Montessori and grow with kids, helping any age learn through play and exploration in the playroom.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\uddd0 If you\u2019re looking for\u2026\r\n- Toddler games for child development\r\n- Games for kids with ADHD or Autism\r\n- Learning with values of Montessori\r\n- Toddler games that are low-stimulation and calming\r\n- Fun preschool games that help learn for kindergarten\r\n- Educational games to supplement your child\u2019s pre-K, kindergarten or first-grade homework\r\n- Baby and toddler games to learn skills through Montessori methods\r\n- ASMR for your toddler and preschool kid\r\n- Games with minimalist, Montessori visuals\r\n- Creative drawing and coloring, shapes\r\n- Offline, no wifi needed play\r\n\r\nTry Pok Pok FREE with your kids today!\r\n\r\nOur growing Montessori digital playroom includes games like:\r\n\ud83d\udcda Busy Book for baby or toddler world knowledge\r\n\ud83c\udfe1 House for social skills and pretend-play\r\n\ud83d\udd35 Marble Machine to learn early STEM skills\r\n\ud83e\udd96 Dinosaurs for kids curious about dinos and biology\r\n\ud83d\udc57 Dress-Up for self-expression\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Drawing and coloring game for creativity, learning shapes \r\n\ud83d\udcc0 Music Sequencer for making music\r\n\ud83e\udde9 World Puzzle for world-building and learning logic\r\nAnd much more!\r\n\r\nPok Pok games are 100% safe for toddlers\u2014free of the bad stuff!\r\n- No ads\r\n- No in-app purchases\r\n- No overstimulating color palette\r\n- No confusing menus or language\r\n- A locked Grown-Ups Area\r\n- No Wi-Fi needed (offline play)\r\n\r\n\ud83e\ude80 TO PLAY\r\nChoose any game in the playroom and tap it to start playing. Tinker, learn and get creative the way you would in a real preschool playroom! Just like in a Montessori classroom, kids are free to explore on their own, which grows confidence. Your toddler or preschool kid will love the freedom!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc8e  WHY IT\u2019S UNIQUE\r\nPok Pok is a peaceful, sensory-friendly experience thanks to our soft, hand-recorded sounds and slow-paced animations.\r\n\r\nMontessori principles inspire a calming design. Your toddler and preschooler can play and learn independently. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83c\udfeb MADE BY EXPERTS\r\nPok Pok is a mom-founded company on a mission to help raise the next generation of creative thinkers! We loved Montessori play for our own toddler and preschool kids. Now, we work with early childhood education experts to create safe, Montessori learning games that are also fun for your toddler, preschooler, kindergarten kid and beyond!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd12 PRIVACY\r\nPok Pok is COPPA compliant. Free of ads, in-app purchases or sneaky fees. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf9f\ufe0f SUBSCRIPTION\r\nSubscribe once and get access to everything in the Montessori playroom and share across all of your family's devices. \r\n\r\nSubscription will automatically renew 24 hours before the end of your subscription period unless you cancel it at least 24 hours before the end of the current period through the Menu in the Google Play Store. Payment will only be charged at confirmation of purchase once your free trial has ended. \r\n\r\nFrom baby to toddler to big kid stages, have fun with play, inspired by Montessori values!\r\n\r\nwww.playpokpok.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Pok Pok is a Montessori-inspired playroom for kids aged 2-8. Our interactive learning games are open-ended with no levels, winning or losing. This makes for calming and non-addictive play so kids can stay regulated, which also means less tantrums! Offline play means no Wi-Fi needed.<br><br>Try Pok Pok for free today!<br><br>\ud83c\udfc6 WINNER OF: <br>APPLE DESIGN AWARD <br>ACADEMICS\u2019 CHOICE AWARD<br>APP STORE AWARD<br>BEST LEARNING APP KIDSCREEN AWARD<br>GOOD HOUSEKEEPING AWARD<br><br>*As seen in Forbes, TechCrunch, Business Insider, CNET, etc!*<br><br>Whether you have a baby, toddler, preschool kid, first-grader or beyond, our educational games are inspired by Montessori and grow with kids, helping any age learn through play and exploration in the playroom.<br><br>\ud83e\uddd0 If you\u2019re looking for\u2026<br>- Toddler games for child development<br>- Games for kids with ADHD or Autism<br>- Learning with values of Montessori<br>- Toddler games that are low-stimulation and calming<br>- Fun preschool games that help learn for kindergarten<br>- Educational games to supplement your child\u2019s pre-K, kindergarten or first-grade homework<br>- Baby and toddler games to learn skills through Montessori methods<br>- ASMR for your toddler and preschool kid<br>- Games with minimalist, Montessori visuals<br>- Creative drawing and coloring, shapes<br>- Offline, no wifi needed play<br><br>Try Pok Pok FREE with your kids today!<br><br>Our growing Montessori digital playroom includes games like:<br>\ud83d\udcda Busy Book for baby or toddler world knowledge<br>\ud83c\udfe1 House for social skills and pretend-play<br>\ud83d\udd35 Marble Machine to learn early STEM skills<br>\ud83e\udd96 Dinosaurs for kids curious about dinos and biology<br>\ud83d\udc57 Dress-Up for self-expression<br>\ud83c\udfa8 Drawing and coloring game for creativity, learning shapes <br>\ud83d\udcc0 Music Sequencer for making music<br>\ud83e\udde9 World Puzzle for world-building and learning logic<br>And much more!<br><br>Pok Pok games are 100% safe for toddlers\u2014free of the bad stuff!<br>- No ads<br>- No in-app purchases<br>- No overstimulating color palette<br>- No confusing menus or language<br>- A locked Grown-Ups Area<br>- No Wi-Fi needed (offline play)<br><br>\ud83e\ude80 TO PLAY<br>Choose any game in the playroom and tap it to start playing. Tinker, learn and get creative the way you would in a real preschool playroom! Just like in a Montessori classroom, kids are free to explore on their own, which grows confidence. Your toddler or preschool kid will love the freedom!<br><br>\ud83d\udc8e  WHY IT\u2019S UNIQUE<br>Pok Pok is a peaceful, sensory-friendly experience thanks to our soft, hand-recorded sounds and slow-paced animations.<br><br>Montessori principles inspire a calming design. Your toddler and preschooler can play and learn independently. <br><br>\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83c\udfeb MADE BY EXPERTS<br>Pok Pok is a mom-founded company on a mission to help raise the next generation of creative thinkers! We loved Montessori play for our own toddler and preschool kids. Now, we work with early childhood education experts to create safe, Montessori learning games that are also fun for your toddler, preschooler, kindergarten kid and beyond!<br><br>\ud83d\udd12 PRIVACY<br>Pok Pok is COPPA compliant. Free of ads, in-app purchases or sneaky fees. <br><br>\ud83c\udf9f\ufe0f SUBSCRIPTION<br>Subscribe once and get access to everything in the Montessori playroom and share across all of your family&#39;s devices. <br><br>Subscription will automatically renew 24 hours before the end of your subscription period unless you cancel it at least 24 hours before the end of the current period through the Menu in the Google Play Store. Payment will only be charged at confirmation of purchase once your free trial has ended. <br><br>From baby to toddler to big kid stages, have fun with play, inspired by Montessori values!<br><br>www.playpokpok.com",
